      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu kubonekerwa okundi Omukama akanyoleka Yoshua Omukuhani Nyamukuru ayemeleire omu maisho g'omumalaikawe. Yoshua ogwo Sitani akaba amwemeleire aha mukono gwa bulyo kwija kumutoijera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama agambira Sitani ati, “Iwe Sitani, Omukama nakakukabukire! Omukama aronkire Yerusalemu nakakukabukire! Tolikumanya okwo ogu ali kichumukulira ky'omuliro?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho Yoshua akaba ayemeleire omu maisho g'omumalaika, ajwete emyendo y'enziro zingi muno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omumalaika yagambira abamwemeleire omu maisho ati, “Mumujure ebijwaro ebyo ebitokoire muno.” Amara agambira Yoshua ogwo ati, “Leba, nakwiyaho entambara zawe, nyije nkujweke ebijwaro ebirungi muno.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nanye nagira nti, “Bamute ekilemba kilikwera omu mutwe.” Kityo bamuta ekilemba kilikwera omu mutwe bamujweka n'ebijwaro. Omumalaika w'Omukama akaba ayemeleireho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.3.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahanyuma omumalaika w'Omukama agambira Yoshua ati, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Omukama w'amahe nagamba ati: K'orakora ebyo ndikwenda okekomya n'ebyo ndikukuragira, aho oragendelera kulebelera Rwensinga yange na nyarubuga zayo. Mara aho ndahuliraga enshara zawe nk'okwo ndikuhulira enshara z'abamalaika abandi omu maisho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbwenu iwe Yoshua Omukuhani Nyamukuru, hulira iwe na batahi bawe abakushuntama omu maisho, kuba bantu b'okumanywaho ebirungi: Leba naija kuboleka omukozi wange, Itagi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aha ibare elyo ntaire omu maisho ga Yoshua, ibare limoi elina embaju mushanju, ninyija kulibaijaho ebihandiko. Alikugamba Mukama w'amahe. Kandi ensi egi ndigigarulira entambara zayo omu kiro kimoi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kir'ekyo, inywena muligira emilembe; buli omoi alyeta mutahiwe kushuntama hamoi aha muzabibugwe anga aha mutinigwe. Alikugamba Mukama w'amahe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.3.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
